WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.600
Control HUB centralises CMMC L2 readiness, evidence, monitoring, POA&M, and reporting.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.600
The dashboard shows live readiness health, evidence quality, monitoring status, and recommended next actions.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.600
Tenant-connected pre-assessment identifies gaps and auto-links findings to 110 CMMC controls.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.600
Each control has implementation guidance, evidence, tasks, monitoring, POA&M, and SSP mapping.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:32.600
Evidence is tagged by control, domain, type, owner, and review date — ready for assessors.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:38.600
The Monitoring Tracker proves ongoing compliance with weekly, monthly, and quarterly reviews.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:44.600
POA&Ms keep remediation tied to controls, owners, risk levels, and supporting evidence.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:50.600
Policy and procedure library with version control, review workflows, and gap analysis.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:55.600
Control HUB: one platform from pre-assessment through ongoing CMMC L2 compliance.

